<title>USA: Appaloosa group has 6.74 pct INAMED stake.</title>
<headline>Appaloosa group has 6.74 pct INAMED stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Appaloosa Management L.P., a Short Hills, N.J., investment adviser, said Monday it has acquired a 6.74 percent stake in INAMED Corp.</p>
<p>In a filng with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it holds 539,000 common shares of INAMED, including 288,000 shares purchased between August 18 and 20 for $8.3325 to $ 9.2175 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
